WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.477
Reconcile the requirement matrix, executed
tests,

2
00:00:03.597 --> 00:00:06.413
original evidence and deviation status.

3
00:00:06.533 --> 00:00:09.223
A missing test does not become complete

4
00:00:09.343 --> 00:00:12.102
because its row appears in the protocol.

5
00:00:12.222 --> 00:00:16.911
Identify supported claims, restrictions
and unresolved dependencies.

6
00:00:17.031 --> 00:00:21.100
The report should allow a reviewer to
trace each conclusion

7
00:00:21.220 --> 00:00:25.358
without guessing which record or
configuration it describes.

8
00:00:25.978 --> 00:00:28.668
Eleven of twelve planned checks passing

9
00:00:28.788 --> 00:00:32.393
gives about 91.7% passing proportion.

10
00:00:32.513 --> 00:00:35.272
If the remaining protective test failed,

11
00:00:35.392 --> 00:00:38.426
the percentage does not justify ignoring
it.

12
00:00:38.546 --> 00:00:43.236
The course practice target is unrelated to
qualification acceptance.

13
00:00:43.356 --> 00:00:46.184
Evaluate the significance of that failure

14
00:00:46.304 --> 00:00:49.890
and its implications for the proposed next
activity.

15
00:00:50.510 --> 00:00:53.902
Use successful OQ knowledge to support
operating

16
00:00:54.022 --> 00:00:56.918
and cleaning procedures, operator training

17
00:00:57.038 --> 00:00:59.797
and preventive maintenance requirements.

18
00:00:59.917 --> 00:01:02.676
Finalizing a cleaning procedure does not

19
00:01:02.796 --> 00:01:05.761
establish validated cleaning
effectiveness.

20
00:01:05.881 --> 00:01:09.674
Transfer the tested configuration,
operating boundaries

21
00:01:09.794 --> 00:01:12.208
and restrictions to the next stage.

22
00:01:12.328 --> 00:01:17.432
Product performance and process validation
remain separate evidence needs.

23
00:01:18.052 --> 00:01:21.845
For the capstone, write a conclusion that
distinguishes

24
00:01:21.965 --> 00:01:25.275
demonstrated performance from unresolved
matters

25
00:01:25.395 --> 00:01:28.568
and identifies the next-stage decision
needed.

26
00:01:28.688 --> 00:01:33.239
Responsible personnel authorize
progression under the site system.

27
00:01:33.359 --> 00:01:36.325
This course provides a self-study
exercise,

28
00:01:36.445 --> 00:01:38.790
not a signed qualification report,

29
00:01:38.910 --> 00:01:44.030
competence certification or authorization
to manufacture a real product.
